ayer co-op with up to 10 Granvir pilots at a time. Share parts and resources utilizing the squad depot in rest areas as you plan your next moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668270/extras/43b662ce0a3a98c5f207642ca65f31a8.avif?t=1773355355\" width=900 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668270/extras/bccbac85b028f886db8fe6f6007ed786.poster.avif?t=1773355355\" width=780 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668270/extras/bccbac85b028f886db8fe6f6007ed786.webm?t=1773355355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>No campaign is the same as you manage time, resources and your route to each objective. Each zone impacts what services and resources are available. Use down time between missions to refit and upgrade your Granvir to prevail.</p>","developers":["Airborne Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668270/bab1b448ebc05a0e14d78d47cecd18939dd81120/header.jpg?t=1773355355","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Debian-based Distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel/AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> N/A</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>